 work?!"],"jaJP":["ふえぇ…書類で山ができちゃってる…男爵って、こんなにお仕事大変なの！？"]},"keys":["Voice_adela_noble_1_TouchReactionBad2","cv_adela_noble_TouchReactionBad2"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/653/6530034@1621809285217203111"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/653/6530034"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/653/6530034@2397460896222568395"]},"audioName":"6530034"},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["一封信！我来打开看看～阁…下…嗯…这上面写的到底什么内容啊…"],"enUS":["A letter! I'll read it out loud! A most c… cordial… uhm… What does this say…."],"jaJP":["手紙、私が読んでみるね、貴…下の…えっと、なんて読むのかな…"]},"keys":["Voice_adela_noble_1_NoticeMail","cv_adela_noble_NoticeMail"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/653/6530035@-6508102414250931982"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/653/6530035"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/653/6530035@-6468090467825459816"]},"audioName":"6530035"},{"type":"NoticeEvent","label":"活动提示","texts":{"zhCN":["派对？我平时交谊舞练得非常认真，为的就是应对这种场合！"],"enUS":["A party? I've been practicing my ballroom dancing for this very moment!"],"jaJP":["パーティー！こんな時のために、社交ダンスは一生懸命練習してたの"]},"keys":["cv_adela_noble_NoticeEvent"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/653/6530036@2106539232006807097"],"enUS":["cdn/Android/ondemand/voices_en/653/6530036"],"jaJP":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_ja/653/6530036@-2921772370871694699"]},"audioName":"6530036"},{"type":"SummonSpeech1","label":"召唤-台词1","texts":{"zhCN":["我是黛西。"],"enUS":["I'm Daisy."],"jaJP":["私はデイジー"]},"keys":["cv_adela_noble_SummonSpeech1"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offline/AssetBundles/Android/ondemand/voices_cn/653/6530094@7797133227598799696"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"6530094"},{"type":"SummonSpeech2","label":"召唤-台词2","texts":{"zhCN":["你很好奇我为什么力气这么大？"],"enUS":["Where'd I get all this strength?"],"jaJP":["どうして、すごい力持ちなのか、知りたいの？"]},"keys":["cv_adela_noble_SummonSpeech2"],"audio":{"zhCN":["offli